    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317">

                <pb facs="0597" n="549" xml:id="pg549"/>

                <head>No. 317.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-08-21"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 21, 1877</date>.
                        (Received September 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 15.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 8, I have the honor to
                    inclose herewith a copy and translation of a note from the Swiss Government,
                    under date of August 14, acknowledging the receipt of four copies of your
                    circular to the diplomatic and consular officers continuing their protection to
                    Swiss citizens, and expressing its gratitude for the same</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>NICHOLAS FISH.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d317-a1.xml" xpointer="d317-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
